Z||000005||AkursedX||09-25-2000||09:48 PM||||I like that car with the fins on the front.  I've been thinking about that.  I have a model of a racing NSX with those little fins on the front for added downforce.  And I know at real high speeds, the front end of the Fiero gets real loose, so I thought about finding some way to manufacture something like that (Not like I'd ever drive fast enough to really use it though  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> )  But it's good to see one of my crazy ideas in reality  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||14
