Z||000007||Seanh||09-25-2000||10:30 PM||||Oh man, you guys are gonna hate me now. I must admit I really like that purple Fiero with the wide fenders. I agree the gator hood thing is pretty nasty lookin. I think that Fiero with the NSX idea doesnt look too bad, but a little too much. I kinda like that body kit Raydar posted. That would be fun for a beach car like a dune buggy fiero. As far as Mercruiser guys car, those engines get my boat up to speed great, I wouldnt ever think about putting on in my Fiero, but hey, it runs. That interior of that car is just down right discusting though. I think he conveyed his boat message very well. As for that stretched Fiero. umm. NO. but just think of the room you would have for you engine. Can you say V12?<P>------------------<BR>Sean Heberly<BR>Silver 86 GT 2.8<BR>Killer Stereo System||||reg||1
