Z||000068||2xsess||09-29-2000||02:23 AM||||Well I'm not a big fan of large graphics but, I have to saw that Fiero5s Fieros would catch and hold my eye!! <BR>Darklord, I want to see pics when you're done...hehe. <BR>I like the stock look of the Fiero, it's timeless, I remember one Fiero owner who said" it will always look like a new car" he was of course spaeking of the body design. I agree. <P>I have to give props to the mercruiser guy, now that's customization.<BR>Imagine what the first guy to put a sbc in his Fiero had to go through, I get deathtrap comments with only my stock 2.8.<P>No one should feel ashamed of the work they've done to their cars. Only be ashamed if you don't treat it with respect!!!<P>OK....I'm done now.<P>Sorry for the long post.<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>85GT||||reg||1
